UT1 Blocklist Data
==================

Source: Université Toulouse Capitole
Mirror: https://github.com/olbat/ut1-blacklists
License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

This directory contains domain lists extracted from the UT1 blocklist project,
used for privacy-aware browser domain classification in screencap.

Only the following categories are included:
  bank, financial, webmail, social_networks, chat, vpn

IP addresses and non-domain entries have been stripped.
